# Phase 9 - model comparison (D-044, docs/09)

Focus set: 192 videos, 22 accounts; target `engagement_high` (100 high / 92 low). Account-grouped 5-fold CV x 3 repeats; tuning on account-grouped inner folds; threshold from training out-of-fold predictions; imputation and scaling inside each training fold. Specification fixed before any fit (D-044). The Zero Sugar inclusion label is weakly reliable (YouTube alpha 0.25, Instagram -0.10).

## Fold make-up (pooled)
Test fold sizes 25-72 videos, 2-6 accounts; share high 0.42-0.68; the global channel's 58 videos sit in one test fold per repeat (3 of 15 folds).

